Add missing system #includes in libartbase and libdexfile

Add <algorithm> to libartbase/base/mem_map.cc (std::max, std::fill),
libdexfile/dex/compact_dex_file.cc and standard_dex_file.cc
(std::copy_n), and <alloca.h> to libdexfile/dex/dex_file_verifier.cc
(alloca()). These files did not include them (crbug.com/40263312).

Chromium commits dcd4e94 and 0928ad0 in libunwindstack.git.

diff --git a/src/libartbase/base/mem_map.cc b/src/libartbase/base/mem_map.cc
index 730a27c..0e8f6ad 100644
--- a/src/libartbase/base/mem_map.cc
+++ b/src/libartbase/base/mem_map.cc
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@
 #include <sys/prctl.h>
 #endif
 
+#include <algorithm>
 #include <map>
 #include <memory>
 #include <sstream>
